# HELP taskq_claim_degradation_ratio The live claim-latency p99 against its rolling 24h baseline (minute-bucketed p99s), per queue. ~10x is the pinned-MVCC-horizon signature: a long transaction is holding VACUUM off and the claim query's scan is degenerating through dead tuples. Runbook: TaskQClaimLatencyDegraded. Reports no data until the baseline has warmed (5 minutes), never a fabricated 1.0.
# TYPE taskq_claim_degradation_ratio gauge
taskq_claim_degradation_ratio{otel_scope_name="taskq",otel_scope_schema_url="",otel_scope_version="0.2.2",queue="default"} 1.1991635957423432
